  "reason": "The free tier advertises all endpoints and leagues at 1,000 requests/day and lists Serie A, fixtures/results, goals, cards and team match statistics. However the official documented team-stat field list does not include corners, leaving six of the original 19 frozen features without a documented source. Detailed data coverage varies by competition and exact Serie A 2026/27 field completeness was not authenticated. Terms allow use in own analysis/products and prohibit raw-feed redistribution, but do not expressly settle ML training, private raw-response retention, or upstream league/provider rights. The API does not document source-first-observed or per-field correction timestamps. No integration is authorized."
